        "# Current context\n",
        "\n",
        "The current context is the context used to resolve context variable values in the executing thread or task. It can be changed by entering another `contextvars.Context`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-current-context)"
      ]
    }
